/*!
    \qmlmodule dev.crowell.AppTheme
    \title dev.crowell.AppTheme QML Module
    \brief Design token singleton for colors, typography, spacing, and radii.

    The AppTheme module provides the \l Theme singleton, which exposes
    dark/light color palettes derived from crowell.dev, an MD3 typography
    scale, spacing constants, border radii, animation durations, and
    accessibility values.
*/

/*!
    \qmlmodule dev.crowell.AppStyle
    \title dev.crowell.AppStyle QML Module
    \brief Custom Qt Quick Controls style using AppTheme tokens.

    The AppStyle module provides themed replacements for standard
    Qt Quick Controls 2 components. Each control extends its
    QtQuick.Templates counterpart and applies AppTheme design tokens
    for a consistent branded appearance.
*/

/*!
    \qmlmodule dev.crowell.QtQuickTemplate
    \title dev.crowell.QtQuickTemplate QML Module
    \brief Application entry point, navigation, layouts, and pages.

    The QtQuickTemplate module contains the root ApplicationWindow,
    the NavigationController, adaptive layout templates
    (portrait and landscape), organism-level components (Header, Footer),
    and all application pages.
*/
